    "拔掉電源": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unplugged"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拿著裝置靠近或遠離 Mac，看哪一台的訊號跟著變，就是它。iPhone 和 Apple Watch 要登入和這台 Mac 相同的 Apple 帳號，Mac 才認得出同一台裝置；其他廠牌的裝置如果會定期更換藍牙位址，就沒辦法持續追蹤。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move a device closer to or farther from your Mac and watch which signal changes. iPhone and Apple Watch must be signed in to the same Apple Account as this Mac to be recognized consistently. Devices from other makers that change their Bluetooth address periodically can't be tracked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按下新的組合鍵…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press Shortcut…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接著電源": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On power adapter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接著電源時通常放在固定的地方，例如家裡的書桌；帶出門用電池時才自動鎖定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When plugged in, your Mac is usually somewhere fixed, like your desk at home. Lock automatically only when you're out on battery."
          }
        }
      }
    },
