    "有裝置在兩個位置的訊號太接近，鎖定門檻已自動拉開。建議把鎖定位置再走遠一點重新校準。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some devices had similar signals at both spots, so their lock thresholds were widened automatically. Try recalibrating from farther away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未允許": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not allowed"
          }
        }
      }
