    },
    "藍牙%@。收不到訊號超過逾時時間後會自動鎖定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth: %@. Your Mac will lock automatically if no signal is received within the timeout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "藍牙已恢復": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bluetooth is back"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "藍牙關閉或收不到訊號時也會在逾時後鎖定。用螢幕保護程式鎖定時，要在系統設定把「螢幕保護程式啟動後要求密碼」設為「立即」，否則 Presence 會改用直接鎖定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Mac also locks after the timeout if Bluetooth is off or there's no signal. To lock with the screen saver, set “Require password after screen saver begins” to “Immediately” in System Settings; otherwise Presence locks the screen directly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "螢幕保護程式啟動後沒有鎖定，已改用鎖定螢幕。請到系統設定把「螢幕保護程式啟動或螢幕關閉後要求密碼」設為「立即」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The screen saver started without locking, so Presence locked the screen instead. In System Settings, set “Require password after screen saver begins or display is turned off” to “Immediately”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "螢幕已鎖定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screen locked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "螢幕沒有亮起，這次沒有解鎖": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The display didn't wake, so the Mac wasn't unlocked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "被動模式": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passive mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "裝置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Devices"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要清除所有紀錄嗎？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clear all history?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "解鎖 %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unlock %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "解鎖門檻": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unlock threshold"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "訊號 %lld dBm": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signal %lld dBm"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "訊號低於門檻多久才鎖定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lock after weak signal for"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "訊號在幾秒內持續高於解鎖門檻才會解鎖，單一筆異常的強訊號不算。關掉「靠近時喚醒螢幕」後，要等你按鍵盤或滑鼠叫醒螢幕才會解鎖，比較安全。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Mac unlocks only when the signal stays above the unlock threshold for a few seconds; a single unusually strong reading doesn't count. With “Wake display when nearby” off, it unlocks only after you wake the display with the keyboard or mouse, which is safer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定密碼…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set Password…"
          }
        }
      }
