    "讀取鑰匙圈失敗（%d），這次沒有自動解鎖": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't read the keychain (%d), so the Mac wasn't unlocked"
