          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "連續 %lld 次自動解鎖失敗，已停止自動解鎖。如果改過登入密碼，請重新設定；否則可以在「鎖定與解鎖」恢復。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic unlock failed %lld times in a row and has been turned off. If you changed your login password, set it again; otherwise resume it in Lock & Unlock."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "連續解鎖失敗，已停止自動解鎖。如果改過登入密碼，請重新設定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic unlock stopped after repeated failures. If you changed your login password, set it again."
